# ============================================================================
# Docker build context exclusions for the LinkShift backend.
#
# The Dockerfile COPYs selectively, so this file is defense-in-depth: it
# shrinks the build context and guarantees secrets/logs never even reach
# the daemon.
#
# NEVER exclude: prisma/ (schema + migrations, used by generate + migrate),
# prisma.config.ts, GeoLite2-City.mmdb (runtime dependency), package*.json,
# tsconfig.json, src/.
# ============================================================================

# --- secrets: must never enter the image ------------------------------------
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx

# --- dependencies & build output (rebuilt inside the image) ------------------
node_modules/
dist/
src/generated/

# --- version control & CI ----------------------------------------------------
.git/
.gitignore
.github/

# --- tests & tooling artifacts (not needed at runtime) -----------------------
tests/
coverage/
vitest.config.ts
backend/tests/e2e/

# --- local dev/debug leftovers ------------------------------------------------
*.log
logs/
server.err.log
server.out.log
_gen-token.*
_repro-billing.*
*.tsbuildinfo
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# --- docs ---------------------------------------------------------------------
ENVIRONMENT.md
Design.md
README*
